휘관은... 사람들과 잘 어울리지 못하는 것 같은데 어쩜 좋지...","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/408110/feeling1.ogg"},"낯섦":{"voiceline":"어둠 속에 잠복해 있는 미지의 공포, 가장 쉽게 인간의 마음속에 공포를 일으키는, 꼭 전쟁터의 잠수함 같은 존재라 할 수 있지... 히히","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/408110/feeling2.ogg"},"호감":{"voiceline":"잠수함에 빠질 수 없는 건 바로 \"인내심\"이지. 지휘관은 중요한 사람을 위해 얼마나 기다려 줄 수 있어?","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/408110/feeling3.ogg"},"기쁨":{"voiceline":"\"사냥감\"이 거의 걸려들 거 같은데. 무슨 말이냐고? 조금 이따 알려 줄 테니까 \"인내심\"을 갖고 기다려 줘~","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/408110/feeling4.ogg"},"사랑":{"voiceline":"지휘관 우리 데이트라도 할래?... 너무 갑자기야? 후후, 사실은 오늘의 \"습격\"을 위해서 아주 오래 전부터 준비해 왔는걸? 히히, 어서 \"투항\"하라고♡","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/408110/feeling5.ogg"},"터치3":null,"모항귀환":{"voiceline":"급할수록 돌아가야 하는 거 알지? 잠시 숨을 돌리자고.","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/408110/home.ogg"},"hp 경고":{"voiceline":"나 진지하게 해 볼게...!","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/408110/hp_warning.ogg"},"로그인":{"voiceline":"어서 와 지휘관. 산처럼 쌓인 서류를 처리할 준비는 되있어?","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/408110/login.ogg"},"실패":{"voiceline":"전세 역전은 무리이야... 후퇴하는 수밖에 없겠어~","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/408110/lose.ogg"},"우편":{"voiceline":"잔뜩 쌓아놓고 하나씩 확인하는 편지도 좋지만, 좋은 습관이라곤 할 수 없겠지?","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/408110/mail.ogg"},"임무":{"voiceline":"히히, 지휘관도 마지막 순간에 임무를 완수하는 짜릿함을 추구하는 사람일까?","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/408110/mission.ogg"},"임무완료":{"voiceline":"임무를 완성하는 과정이 더 